  "note": "Same format as track01.json. A bonus Track, outside the set list: the home of JAM (design/modes/jam.md), where a child switches the band's layers on and off one by one. So it is written for any combination of its layers: C add 9, A minor 7, F major 7 and G with its fourth instead of its third, whose upper notes are all from one five-note scale (C D E G A), and a lead, stabs and bass lines that use nothing else above the bass. No layer can clash with another, at any moment, in any order. Character: a music box over a soft four on the floor, the slowest Track in the game; bell stabs on one and three, a round bass on root, fifth and octave, a long echo.",
